OL,3,GNEWSAFinal phase of beach protection
OL,4,Awork under way
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe #42m scheme is aimed at protecting
OL,7,Fthe coastline, from Sandbanks to
OL,8,FHengistbury Head, from flooding and
OL,9,Ferosion for the next 100 years.
